flowchart TD
    A[Developer starts Python virtual environment] --> B[Uvicorn loads app.main]
    B --> C[FastAPI service listens on localhost:8000]

    D[Client sends multipart POST] --> E[FastAPI binds field named file]
    E --> F{Content type supported?}

    F -- No --> G[Return 415 detail response]
    F -- Yes --> H[Read at most 10 MB plus one byte]

    H --> I{File empty?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Return 400 detail response]
    I -- No --> K{File exceeds 10 MB?}

    K -- Yes --> L[Return 413 detail response]
    K -- No --> M[Create deterministic mock OCR result]

    M --> N[Pydantic validates response model]
    N --> O[Serialize snake case fields using JSON aliases]
    O --> P[Return lines, fullText, and processingTimeMs]

    P --> Q[.NET PaddleOcrClient can deserialize response]